{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-19088-r4636109","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Thousand Island Dressing","sourcePageId":19088,"sourceRevision":"4636109","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-05-16T23:00:53Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Thousand%20Island%20Dressing&oldid=4636109","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:18:16.807Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Californian recipes","Category:Mayonnaise recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for salad dressing","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using ketchup","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"27373ac86bb6189041b1d4ed1ae68f527b4fa5b706d3459803511d730af653ba","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Salad dressing recipes\n| Yield = 1½ cups|servings=6 (1/4 cup each)|time=10 minutes|difficulty=1\n}}\n__NOTOC__\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Salad Recipes|Salad Recipes]] | [[Cookbook:Appetizers|Appetizers]] | [[Cookbook:California cuisine|California cuisine]]\n\n'''Thousand Island''' is a salad dressing commonly used with green salads.  It can also be used as a  sandwich spread, or many other uses.\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (235 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) [[Cookbook:Mayonnaise|mayonnaise]]\n* ¼ cup (60 ml) [[Cookbook:Ketchup|ketchup]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] (30 ml) white [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* 1 tablespoon (15 ml) [[Cookbook:Granulated Sugar|granulated sugar]]\n* 1 tablespoon (15 ml) sweet [[Cookbook:Pickle|pickle]] [[Cookbook:Relish|relish]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoons]] (10 ml) finely-minced [[Cookbook:Onion|onions]]\n* ¼ teaspoon (1 ml) [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 dash of [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Combine all ingredients in a [[Cookbook:Blender|blender]], and process till smooth. The goal is to have a pink smooth sauce.\n# Pour the sauce into a bowl and chill covered in the refrigerator for at least 30 minutes prior to use.\n\n==Notes, tips and variations==\n* Instead of using the blender, whisk the ingredients in a bowl.\n\n==Warnings==\n* Keep refrigerated.\n\n[[Category:Californian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for salad dressing]]\n[[Category:Mayonnaise recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ketchup]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Thousand Island Dressing","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 cup (235 ml) mayonnaise","sourceText":"1 cup (235 ml) mayonnaise","amountText":"1 cup (235 ml) mayonnaise","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"¼ cup (60 ml) ketchup","sourceText":"¼ cup (60 ml) ketchup","amountText":"¼ cup (60 ml) ketchup","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 tablespoons (30 ml) white vinegar","sourceText":"2 tablespoons (30 ml) white vinegar","amountText":"2 tablespoons (30 ml) white vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tablespoon (15 ml) granulated sugar","sourceText":"1 tablespoon (15 ml) granulated sugar","amountText":"1 tablespoon (15 ml) granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tablespoon (15 ml) sweet pickle relish","sourceText":"1 tablespoon (15 ml) sweet pickle relish","amountText":"1 tablespoon (15 ml) sweet pickle relish","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 teaspoons (10 ml) finely-minced onions","sourceText":"2 teaspoons (10 ml) finely-minced onions","amountText":"2 teaspoons (10 ml) finely-minced onions","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"¼ teaspoon (1 ml) salt","sourceText":"¼ teaspoon (1 ml) salt","amountText":"¼ teaspoon (1 ml) salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1 dash of pepper","sourceText":"1 dash of pepper","amountText":"1 dash of pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Combine all ingredients in a blender, and process till smooth. The goal is to have a pink smooth sauce.","sourceText":"Combine all ingredients in a blender, and process till smooth. The goal is to have a pink smooth sauce.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"Pour the sauce into a bowl and chill covered in the refrigerator for at least 30 minutes prior to use.","sourceText":"Pour the sauce into a bowl and chill covered in the refrigerator for at least 30 minutes prior to use.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:19088","recordId":"wikibooks-19088-r4636109","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4636109","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Thousand%20Island%20Dressing&oldid=4636109","